{"metadata":{"slug":[{"Plain":"Iwahori子群"},0],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"title":[{"Plain":"Iwahori 子群"},2],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>观念</h2>\n<p>Iwahori 子群是 "},{"Local":{"url":"Borel子群","text":"Borel 子群"}},{"Plain":"的 $p$-进类比.</p>\n<h2>例</h2>\n<h3>$\\mathrm{GL}_n$</h3>\n<p>$\\mathrm{GL}_n(\\mathbb{Z}_p)$ 中模 $p$ 上三角的元素构成 Iwahori 子群. 例如 $n=2$ 时一个标准的 Iwahori 子群为\n$$\r\n\\Big\\{\r\n    \\begin{pmatrix}\r\n        a &amp; b \\\\ c &amp; d\r\n    \\end{pmatrix}\r\n    \\in \\mathrm{GL}_2(\\mathbb{Z}_p)\r\n    \\Bigm| c\\equiv 0 \\operatorname{mod} p\r\n\\Big\\}.\r\n$$</p>\n"}]}}